      "blockers": "Re-rendered and validated 2026-10-01; un-held 2026-10-04 (ships in the next release, licence pending). 133 NCOG samples, all timed and keyed by their calcofi_bottle cast (match_by_site_datetime, then a Niskin bottle within 4 m by match_nearest_by_depth), CC1611 included. 71 sequenced samples publish 497 edna_presence obs (15 detections); the 62 PCR-negative samples are held as sample rows with no obs until Q04 is answered. Dc keyed to Delphinus capensis; line/station from the sample name (Q10). Open: licence Q01, citation Q02, provider Q03, PCR negatives Q04.",
